'''Pikotaro''' (ピコ太郎) is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in the [[Pikotaro Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]].


{{Enemy Info
|name = Pikotaro
|image = E 305.png
|appearance = [[Pikotaro Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 5,000¢ - 19,750¢
}}

==Enemy==
Pikotaro is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy, which means he only takes 1 damage from all attacks except for [[Critical Hit]]s. On the contrary, Pikotaro has very high attack damage which can kill most Cat Units in one hit. However, his backswing is also long so stalling him won't be an issue at all.

==Strategy==
Since his attack rate is quite slow and [[PPAP|his stage]] does not have [[Assassin Bear]] to force lose the player when they take too much time, using fast-hitting cats is an effective way to deal with him. Even spamming [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] is enough to kill him. [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] can also be helpful to stop Pikotaro from getting near to your base. You could also use a fast attacking [[Critical Hit|critter]], such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]], however you would require good luck to get a critical on the 1st hit, either that or send out a fast meatshield and Catasaurus, then get a critical hit before his next attack.

